// 009.2 / 010.4: an integer literal coerces to a Time or Duration component of a product type; an integer fact still does not.
Fact item Identified by A
Fact instant Identified by Time
Fact window Identified by Duration
Fact sunset Identified by item * instant
Fact hold-time Identified by item * window.

+sunset(A, 100).
+hold-time(A, 15).
?sunset(A, 100).
?hold-time(A, 15).
